Package: cVAEPyro
Title: Conditional Variational Autoencoder via Pyro for Seurat Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("GWMcElfresh", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "placeholder@example.com"))
Description: Wraps Pyro's conditional variational autoencoder (cVAE) framework
    for use with Seurat single-cell data objects. Provides functions to extract
    gene expression and metadata, train cVAE models via Python, plot diagnostics,
    and perform counterfactual forward-pass predictions.
